  <item>
    <title>VOL.10 请回答2025:减肥失败、书没看完、内耗一整年，那又如何？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69ee18201e94ae692133315b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69ee18201e94ae692133315b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见呀，大家过的好吗？虽然2026年已经开始了将近四分之一 ，但是我们还是想回顾一下2025年我们具体收获了哪些。 所以本期节目我们仨一起探讨了2025年发生在自身说的种种以及一些遗憾。我个人对这期节目启发还是蛮大 的，希望也能给你带来一些共鸣。(By 讲一万）&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播🎙️ ：</span></p><span></span><p><span>讲一万、清子酱、刘下来</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期剪辑✂️：</span></p><span></span><p><span>讲一万</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>✨主要内容以及节点</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1.哪三个词形容2025年的自己？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">01:12</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;讲一万的2025三个关键词：忙碌、稳定、平淡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">03:21</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;清子酱的2025三个关键词：与自己建立连接、生动、规律</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="736">12:16</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;刘下来的2025三个关键词：内耗、成长、摸索</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>2.去年立的flag都实现了吗？实现多少？为什么不能实现？可以完善和改进的地方？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="878">14:38</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;讲一万的flag盘点：日本签证、书店活动、买包 ✅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="978">16:18</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;未完成flag：播客更新、体重控制、持续学习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1172">19:32</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;清子酱的flag盘点：带父母旅游、学车 ✅ / 减肥、记账、出国游 ❌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1265">21:05</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;为什么flag立了做不到？自驱力+规划+心情内核</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1312">21:52</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;PDCA减肥法 &amp; 推荐博主“真理之弓”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1487">24:47</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;刘下来的flag：技能类几乎全军覆没&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>3. 2025生长出来的内在力量 &nbsp;</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1826">30:26</a>讲一万推荐《当下的力量》：不抓过去、不焦虑未来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2008">33:28</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;清子酱分享《悉达多》感悟：没有过去，没有未来，你就是现在</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2112">35:12</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;知行合一的难与解：先粗糙启动，干中学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">40:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;刘下来的感悟：道理学了没用，得到现实中去做</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>4.世界新发现：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2570">42:50</a> 2025新发现：讲一万接触塔罗牌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2653">44:13</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;职场不愉快：同事间的small talk尬聊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2721">45:21</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;清子酱的新发现：跳舞带来的甜头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3156">52:36</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;刘下来聊运动尝试的困难 &amp; 讨好型人格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3223">53:43</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;“跳舞可能不是你的正缘运动”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>5.2026年期许：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3295">54:55</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;讲一万的2026期许：健康、工作稳定、少刷抖音多看书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3420">57:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;清子酱的2026期许：顺势而为、找到内心小火苗、减肥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3492">58:12</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;遵从内心：找到真正想做的事，先当爱好再当副业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3571">59:31</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;刘下来的2026期许：多做少内耗、学会表达与求助</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵本期bgm: リセット-Reset (向井太一)&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/65afe369ed56461b97cb44da/lr3CSMoNuy0_5nZo6KXkzRu6mnG_.m4a" length="61823793" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:03:42</itunes:duration>
