    <guid isPermaLink="false">665dc06263c334a2fb141a78</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 03 Jun 2024 13:08:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天这期节目我们光海组（INFJ &amp; ENT/FP）来为大家推荐一些在业余生活中陪伴我们的“电子榨菜”和“互联网充电器”们，赶快来听听看有没有你喜欢的博主吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这个信息爆炸的时代，你是否也觉得自己对这些博主产生了依赖呢？希望本期节目能为大家带来一些新的发现，乐趣和一些思考。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>主要节目内容以及节点：</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:53</a> 业余生活中刷手机时间的探讨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="177">02:57</a> 主要使用哪些平台（小红书，微博，哔哩哔哩，抖音等）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">05:22</a> 小红书居然有窃听功能？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>吃播以及探店类博主推荐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 小紧张虫虫-哔哩哔哩 ，JASON刘雨鑫-哔哩哔哩，就是气气-哔哩哔哩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> 探店博主推荐：Taste 武汉 -哔哩哔哩</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Vlog 生活类博主推荐</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="809">13:29</a>晋晋除了吃还是吃，热爱生活的猴子，芽腿，皮皮在蓝色星球-哔哩哔哩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a> Kelly Yang -Youtube / 哔哩哔哩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="945">15:45</a> BelindaChen-哔哩哔哩</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>成长类博主推荐:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1074">17:54</a> &nbsp;36氪，小Lin说，凉子访谈录，摩尔家的陈泰山, 姜dora在此- 哔哩哔哩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1121">18:41</a> &nbsp;Ruowen Huang -哔哩哔哩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1253">20:53</a> &nbsp;天真不天真 -小宇宙</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>信息补充类博主推荐</span></strong><span>：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1414">23:34</a>文化有限-小宇宙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1442">24:02</a>科技早知道 -小宇宙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1515">25:15</a>老高与小茉-哔哩哔哩/youtube</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1603">26:43</a>纵横四海-小宇宙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1715">28:35</a> 1900、木鱼水心 （影剧作品解读）-哔哩哔哩</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>养生类博主推荐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1779">29:39</a> Amy小北京，养生饮品主理人-微博</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1943">32:23</a> 美女甜奶糕 （现在的名字是：爱吃甜奶糕 -微博）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>娱乐博主推荐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2068">34:28</a> 凹凸电波 -小宇宙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2103">35:03</a> 听泉鉴宝-抖音直播</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2183">36:23</a> papi酱 -抖音，小红书，哔哩哔哩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2299">38:19</a> nya酱的一生-抖音，小红书，哔哩哔哩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2473">41:13</a> 为什么我们会喜欢这些博主</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2769">46:09</a> 这些博主对受众和社会的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3158">52:38</a> 我们做自媒体的初衷</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期bgm：Once in a moon by Sarah Kang</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>如果你喜欢我们的节目的话，别忘了订阅哦!</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>你也可以通过小红书找到我们，搜索“放空调频”。</span></p>]]></description>
