  <item>
    <title>VOL.3 甄嬛传：女力崛起之照进现实</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/661b5a4c5dae7932c656fe92</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">661b5a4c5dae7932c656fe92</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 14 Apr 2024 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>还有谁没看过《甄嬛传》？看甄嬛传只有N遍和0遍啊，本期我们三个漫谈《甄嬛传》：</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么这个剧自2012年问世以后可以经久不衰？</span></p><span></span><p><span>你还记得你看了多少遍甄嬛传吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>电视剧幕后的故事你知道多少？</span></p><span></span><p><span>人物角色MBTI人格大揭秘，你能猜对几个？</span></p><span></span><p><span>哪个角色最让你有感触呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>那些细思极恐的伏笔你发现了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>甄嬛传和现实世界竟然也有相通之处？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们竟从古代女性身上学到了女性主义？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们上两期的MBTI特辑大家有听吗？和这期的《甄嬛传》梦幻接力了，我们中两个人和甄嬛同样是INFJ绿老头人格，这期我们三的光海组又把这个人格下的甄嬛聊得透透的~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主要话题及节点：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="163">02:43</a> &nbsp;电视剧的播出背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="313">05:13</a> &nbsp;蒋欣争取角色的幕后故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">07:22</a> &nbsp;甄嬛是高阶版的INFJ</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="460">07:40</a> &nbsp;电视剧主角易出INFJ人格？高启强是男版甄嬛？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a> &nbsp;甄嬛传不只是爽剧，更是悲剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="798">13:18</a> &nbsp;甄嬛对皇上死心的MBTI解释</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="882">14:42</a> &nbsp;果郡王是ENFP快乐小狗你猜对了吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1127">18:47</a> &nbsp;安陵容让我们看到了在职场卑微牛马的自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1213">20:13</a> &nbsp;拽妃对现世态度的指导：无欲则刚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> &nbsp;跟着甄嬛学共情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">23:05</a> &nbsp;玉娆教会我们勇敢,跟着玉娆学谈恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1461">24:21</a> &nbsp;陈建斌的演技让我们品了又品，不是面瘫是演技真好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a> &nbsp;后宫真正的恋爱脑是：华妃、端妃？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2005">33:25</a> &nbsp;小像事件有多少细节可以挖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2416">40:16</a> &nbsp;甄嬛的认清现实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2707">45:07</a> &nbsp;眉庄活出了那个时代不应该有的独立女性的觉知</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3025">50:25</a> &nbsp;妆造也让人十分欣赏</span></p>]]></description>
